# {{ s.name }} — Unity Spawner

**Variant:** `{{ variant }}`
**Spawn shape:** `{{ s.spawn_shape }}`
**Pooling:** `{{ s.pooling }}`
**Trigger:** `{{ s.trigger }}`

{{ s.description }}

## Install

1. Drop the `Scripts/` folder into your project's `Assets/`.
2. Add the `{{ s.name }}` component to an empty GameObject placed where you want spawning to originate.
3. Assign the **prefab** to spawn in the inspector.
{% if s.pooling == "pooled" %}
4. Add a `{{ s.name }}Pool` component (same or another GameObject), assign the same prefab,
   and drag it into the spawner's `pool` field. Leave it empty to fall back to plain `Instantiate`.
{% endif %}
{% if s.spawn_shape == "spawn_points" %}
5. Create empty GameObjects as spawn points and drag them into the `spawnPoints` array.
{% endif %}
{% if variant == "trigger_spawner" %}
6. Put this GameObject's collider on **Is Trigger**, and tag your player `{{ s.target_tag }}`.
{% endif %}

## Behaviour

{% if variant == "wave_spawner" %}
Spawns **{{ s.wave_count }}** waves of ~**{{ s.per_wave_count }}** each (ramping +50% per wave),
waiting **{{ "%.1f"|format(s.spawn_interval) }}s** between waves. Capped at **{{ s.max_alive }}** alive.
{% elif variant == "continuous_spawner" %}
Spawns one instance every **{{ "%.1f"|format(s.spawn_interval) }}s**, capped at **{{ s.max_alive }}** alive.
{% elif variant == "trigger_spawner" %}
Spawns a burst of **{{ s.per_wave_count }}** when a `{{ s.target_tag }}` enters the trigger.
{% elif variant in ("point_spawner", "radial_spawner") %}
One-shot: spawns **{{ s.per_wave_count }}** instances on `Start()`. Call `Spawn()` for more.
{% elif variant == "object_pool" %}
Pure pool broker — call `Spawn()` (or use `{{ s.name }}Pool` directly) from your gameplay code.
{% endif %}

`Spawn()` is public so timelines, UnityEvents, or other scripts can trigger a spawn manually.

## Tuning

| Field            | Default | Notes |
|------------------|---------|-------|
| `maxAlive`       | {{ s.max_alive }} | live-instance cap (auto-pruned) |
{% if variant in ("wave_spawner", "continuous_spawner", "trigger_spawner") %}
| `spawnInterval`  | {{ "%.1f"|format(s.spawn_interval) }} | seconds between spawns/waves |
{% endif %}
{% if s.spawn_shape in ("circle", "box") %}
| `spawnRadius`    | {{ "%.1f"|format(s.spawn_radius) }} | spawn area size |
{% endif %}
